      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Place beef into a roasting pan. Stir in potatoes, tomato-vegetable juice cocktail, carrots, celery, onion, tapioca, sugar, salt, and pepper. Cover the pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until beef and potatoes are tender, about 5 hours.",
